                <pb facs="0523" n="511" sameAs="frus:frus1937v01/pg511"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.00/5617: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul General at Barcelona</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Perkins</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-06-03T14:00:00-04:00">June 3, 1937—2 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your June 2, 8 p.m. We shall appreciate whatever information you may be able
                    informally and discreetly to obtain as to the number, identity, and present
                    circumstances of the Americans reported to have been aboard the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">City of Barcelona</hi>.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
